\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Contraction in its own domain (frozen, unanchored): rate versus $\kappa \lambda _2$ across two topologies, slope 1.40 (falsifier $< 0.5$); $\mu $ calibrated at $\kappa = 0$, so the identity line is anchored, not predicted. The log-linearity remainder vanishes \emph  {faster} than the registered second order (2.48 [2.32, 2.65]; falsifier band excluded on the favorable side, reported as tripped with the corrected order).}}{6}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:f8}{{7}{6}}
